30| *   concepts before daily use before lookup). Every article belongs to
31| *   exactly one. The order here is the sidebar order: the frontend follows
32| *   the `sections` array of the GET /docs index, which mirrors this list.
33| *
34| *   REQUIRED RENAME PROCEDURE (follow first time — a rename without these
35| *   steps silently drops custom `KAINBAIN_SITE_DOCS` articles carrying old
36| *   `section:` frontmatter; see `DEPRECATIONS.md` "Docs taxonomy rename"):
37| *   1. Choose the new id; update `DOC_SECTIONS` and `SECTION_LABELS` here.
38| *      The frontend and `GET /docs` derive order and labels from
39| *      `buildDocsIndex`, so no other source file needs a hand edit
40| *      (`siteDocs.frontendParity.test.js` locks that contract).
