42| *      entries; aliases are kept forever so old frontmatter keeps indexing.
43| *   3. Add a `DEPRECATIONS.md` entry (retired id, new id, date, automatic
44| *      migration note).
45| *   4. Append the retired id to `KNOWN_SECTION_HISTORY` just below (and any
46| *      brand-new current id too), so the taxonomy guardrail keeps covering it.
47| *   5. Migrate in-repo `site-docs/*.md` frontmatter to the new ids.
