351|/***
352| * MARK: getDoc
353| * @description Returns one article `{ slug, title, section, order, markdown }`
354| *   or null for invalid slugs / unknown articles. Slug-gated (never joins a
355| *   raw user path), so traversal attempts 404 instead of escaping the dir.
356| * @param {string} slug
357| * @param {object} [options]
358| * @param {string} [options.dir] - Content directory override (tests).
